{
  "about": "Changes to the committed file's variables and meta, each with whether the page's loader takes the file. Read by tests/test_forecast_vintages.py (the build's check_document) and src/utils/forecastVintages/document.test.js (the page's forecastVintagesProblem): the two must agree with these and so with each other. A path step is an object key or a list position; append adds to the end of a list.",
